hrm{Ideal}(\\mathcal I,\\mathcal P(X))\">\\(\\mathrm{Ideal}(\\mathcal I,\\mathcal P(X))\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\notin\\mathcal I\">\\(X\\notin\\mathcal I\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"6e4f95381faac4f9\" href=\"?note=6e4f95381faac4f9\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-ideal.md\">../batch05/58-df-ideal.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcIdealIdealCofinality}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcIdealIdealCofinality}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|A|\">\\(|A|\\)</span> 为集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的唯一基数，使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md\">../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md</a> 的基数函数。 非空序数集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\min C\">\\(\\min C\\)</span> 是满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\in C\\land\\forall\\xi\\in C\\;(m\\subseteq\\xi)\">\\(m\\in C\\land\\forall\\xi\\in C\\;(m\\subseteq\\xi)\\)</span> 的唯一 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}cofinality} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcIdealIdealCofinality}_S(\\kappa,\\mathcal I,X) \\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Ideal}(\\mathcal I,\\mathcal P(X))\\land X\\notin\\mathcal I\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\kappa=\\min\\{|\\mathcal B|:\\mathcal B\\subseteq\\mathcal I\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal I\\;\\exists B\\in\\mathcal B\\;(A\\subseteq B)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}cofinality} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcIdealIdealCofinality}_S(\\kappa,\\mathcal I,X) \\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Ideal}(\\mathcal I,\\mathcal P(X))\\land X\\notin\\mathcal I\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\kappa=\\min\\{|\\mathcal B|:\\mathcal B\\subseteq\\mathcal I\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal I\\;\\exists B\\in\\mathcal B\\;(A\\subseteq B)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-ideal.md","status":"resolved","id":"6e4f95381faac4f9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-ideal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-ideal.md","status":"resolved","id":"6e4f95381faac4f9","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesi